  "factualConstraints": [
    "PRODUCT - Coverage: Combat Reviews lists events across multiple combat-sports promotions in one app.",
    "PRODUCT - Events screen: upcoming fights with predictions, full cards, venues, broadcasters and live countdowns.",
    "PRODUCT - Rankings: the product carries fighter rankings alongside the community challenge leaderboard.",
    "PRODUCT - Predictions: points are earned from correct predictions in the CombatReviews Challenge.",
    "PRODUCT - Free to predict: making a prediction costs nothing, and the challenge is skill rather than betting.",
    "PRODUCT - Discussion: each event carries a card-talk discussion region.",
    "PRODUCT - How it is opened: reached on the web, with no verified public store listing.",
    "PROHIBITION - the storyboard's event names, fighter names, records, rankings, predictor ranks, handles and comments are concept UI and are declared PRODUCT_MOCKUP.",
    "PROHIBITION - no store badge, no download promise and no invented performance claim.",
    "PROHIBITION - no agency, studio or existing campaign may be named or imitated."
